# Ablation / experiment model registries. Only the registered model version
# named by MODEL_VERSION belongs in the repo; reproduce ablations with
# SWARMGUARD_FEATURE_SET=<name> python model_train/scripts/train_deployable_v2.py
backend/models_ml/v2_*/

# --- Training data and research environments ---------------------------
# The raw flight corpus is 2.4 GB with individual .ulg/.tlog files over
# GitHub's 100 MB file limit. It is third-party data (Live GPS Spoofing and
# Jamming dataset) and belongs in DVC / release assets, not in git history.
# The training scripts and the resulting registered model are tracked; the
# inputs are not. See model_train/README for how to obtain the corpus.
model_train/dataset/
model_train/uav_venv/
model_train/reports/
*.ulg
*.tlog

# Large generated artifacts
backend/data/*.csv
project_dump*.txt

# Stray local artifacts. The app requires PostgreSQL and rejects SQLite at
# startup, so any *.db here is a leftover experiment -- and may hold test
# credentials. Lighthouse output is a build report, not source.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
frontend/lighthouse-report.json
